00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:01.660
Chinese built Model 3 Premium RWD units reached Canadian ports several days ahead of the scheduled delivery window.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:07.760
Because the vehicles arrived already in right hand drive configuration and ready for final inspection,

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:14.060
the early arrival gives service teams extra calendar time to complete checks before customers take delivery.

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:20.780
The practical effect is that Tesla can bring these refreshed Model 3s into competition on price and range

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:27.080
sooner than if the same volume had to be built at a newer North American site still climbing the RAP curve.

